OL,3,GNEWSAGreen in line to be West Midlands
OL,4,Achief constable
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe acting chief constable of West
OL,7,FMidlands Police has been named as the
OL,8,Fpreferred candidate to get the job on a
OL,9,Fpermanent basis.
OL,11,FThe vacancy arose after the departure
OL,12,Fof Craig Guildford, who left following
OL,13,Fthe controversy over Israeli football
OL,14,Ffans being banned from attending a
OL,15,Fmatch in Birmingham.
OL,17,FGreen has stood in since January and
OL,18,Fhas now been selected by West Midlands
OL,19,FPolice and Crime Commissioner (PCC)
OL,20,FSimon Foster as the preferred candidate
OL,21,Ffor the job.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
